<title>USA: Winstar sells $450 mln of notes.</title>
<headline>Winstar sells $450 mln of notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winstar Communications Inc said Tuesday it had begun an offering of $450 million of notes in three tranches in a 144A institutional private placement.</p>
<p>The company said the offering should be completed in March.</p>
<p>None of the notes are convertible into equity, the company said.</p>
<p>Winstar said proceeds combined with existing resources are expected to fund its business plan for the next 30-36 months.</p>
</text>
